    "title": "Tyler J. Ritter Legacy Fund helps first recipient - NewsBreak",
    "text": "9 hours ago The Tyler J. Ritter Legacy Fund presented a check to its first recipient, the Central Kansas Foundation (CKF) Addiction Treatment facility in Salina. Tyler J. Ritter grew up in Salina, where he attended Sacred Heart. There, he found a passion for basketball. He played the sport for many years, graduating from Sacred Heart in 2016. In 2017, however, Ritter fell and injured his wrists. His doctors prescribed opioids to help with the pain. This led Ritter down the road to his addiction. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
